# Strictest rotation configuration: the pass is enabled AND its Guard G
# register-pressure profitability gate is disabled, so the 32-live-out loop in
# the test really is rotated. Correctness must hold in that configuration;
# the profitability decision itself is pinned by
# tests/regression/check_loop_rotate_pressure.sh.
CCC_LOOP_ROTATE=1
CCC_LOOP_ROTATE_IGNORE_PRESSURE=1
